  "d21: 🍽️ Elijah watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\"",
  "d22: 🍽️ Daria checks the pantry before heading out, then hangs back. \"Shelves are full to bursting. Patching the boots today.\"",
  "d22: 🍽️ Daria carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"",
  "d23: 🍽️ Ursula lingers by the full pantry and laughs. \"Full shelves, full bellies. Mending the palisade today — the fence won't fix itself.\"",
  "d23: 🍽️ Dorothy sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\"",
  "d24: 🍽️ Dorothy checks the pantry before heading out, then hangs back. \"Shelves are full to bursting. Patching the boots today.\"",
  "d24: 🍽️ Daria leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"",
  "d25: 🍽️ Liam peeks into the pantry, then turns the foraging party back. \"Plenty for days. Teaching the kids snares instead — they'll need to know.\"",
  "d25: 🍽️ Liam looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"",
  "d26: 🍽️ Naran eyes the groaning pantry shelves and packs light today. \"No point hauling what'll rot. Mending the nets instead.\"",
  "d26: 🍽️ Carolina watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\"",
  "d27: 🍽️ Vito leaves the foraging basket at the door. \"The pantry can't take more — sitting with the elders instead.\"",
  "d27: 🍽️ Vito sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\"",
  "d28: 🍽️ Liam taps the pantry's fullest jar. \"More than we can eat before it turns. Rendering fat instead — the lamps won't fill themselves.\"",
  "d28: 🍽️ Naran watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""
 ],
